==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|bera|lang=non}}.

====Alternative forms====
* [[bere#Norwegian Nynorsk|bere]] (e infinitive)

====Verb====
{{nn-verb|ber|br-pre=berer|bar|bore|bori}}

# to [[carry]], [[bear]]
#: ''Kor langt skal eg '''bera''' dette?''
#:: How far shall I '''carry''' this?

=====References=====
* {{R:Dokumentasjonsprosjektet|lang=nn|bere}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|bera|lang=non}}.

====Alternative forms====
* [[bere#Norwegian Nynorsk|bere]] (main form)

====Noun====
{{nn-noun-f2|ber}} (bracket form)

# a female bear, [[she-bear]]
#: ''Inne mellom trea kunne dei skimta ei '''bera'''.''
#:: Between the trees, they could discern a '''she-bear'''.

